Fork note: upstream 1ee46e02bee, which came after Servo 0.8.0, backported
unchanged except for the separator line of Dependabot's text, written
`----` instead of `---` so that `git am` of this patch file keeps the rest
of the message. libz-sys 1.1.31 has the heap buffer overflow that the
cargo-deny step of `./mach test-tidy` reports on 0.8.0. Drop this patch
at the first sync onto a release that contains #49922, where it applies
empty.

Validation: `./mach test-tidy` on ohos-main 8ca6843c7f9 with this commit and the previous one: the cargo-deny step no longer reports the libz-sys advisory; the chrono one, which the next backport handles, remains. `cargo metadata --locked` resolves; the builds of the stack tip use libz-sys 1.1.33 (see the bookkeeping commit).
